# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following steps compute the four stages in this notebook with [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, and [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), without Prefect. See the [SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) for the details of each computation.\n"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah berikut menghitung empat tahap di notebook ini dengan [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/), [ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/), Qiskit, Qiskit Runtime, dan [`qiskit-addon-sqd`](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), tanpa Prefect. Lihat [tutorial SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) untuk detail setiap komputasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik ke masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Map stage, the task `compute_molecular_integrals` in the workflow, turns the molecule into the inputs of all later stages. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) gives the molecular orbitals, and the active-space integrals leave out the two frozen 1s cores. CCSD gives the $t_2$ amplitudes of the ansatz, and its density matrix gives the orbital occupancies that start configuration recovery. CCSD iterates `CCSD_MAXITER` times, each time from the previous amplitudes, so the result does not depend on the DIIS history of the first iteration. This notebook uses 4 iterations, and the workflow uses 10.\n"
msgstr "Tahap Map, yaitu task `compute_molecular_integrals` di workflow, mengubah molekul menjadi input untuk semua tahap berikutnya. Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF) menghasilkan orbital molekul, dan integral active-space mengabaikan dua inti 1s yang dibekukan. CCSD menghasilkan amplitudo $t_2$ untuk ansatz, dan matriks densitasnya menghasilkan okupansi orbital yang memulai configuration recovery. CCSD berulang sebanyak `CCSD_MAXITER` kali, setiap kali dari amplitudo sebelumnya, sehingga hasilnya tidak bergantung pada riwayat DIIS dari iterasi pertama. Notebook ini memakai 4 iterasi, dan workflow memakai 10.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"How QCSC-Prefect manages this step\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Cara QCSC-Prefect mengelola langkah ini\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace:** The task `compute_molecular_integrals` has the tag `map`. Its result goes to `get_lucj_params` and `sqd_loop`, so two arrows leave it in the graph. The task logs show the PySCF output.\n"
msgstr "**Trace:** Task `compute_molecular_integrals` punya tag `map`. Hasilnya dikirim ke `get_lucj_params` dan `sqd_loop`, jadi ada dua panah keluar darinya di grafik. Log task menampilkan output PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Configure:** The **Molecule** group of the run form selects the problem, as an FCIDUMP file or as a geometry and basis. This workflow reads `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, which has the cores frozen already. The number of CCSD iterations (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 by default) is in the `sqd-advanced-settings` block.\n"
msgstr "**Configure:** Grup **Molecule** di form run memilih masalahnya, sebagai file FCIDUMP atau sebagai geometri dan basis. Workflow ini membaca `algorithms/open_loop/sqd/data/n2_631g_fc.fcidump`, yang intinya sudah dibekukan. Jumlah iterasi CCSD (**CCSD Restarts**, default 10) ada di block `sqd-advanced-settings`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resume:** The result is persisted (`compressed/json`), so **Retry** loads it instead of running PySCF again.\n"
msgstr "**Resume:** Hasilnya disimpan secara persisten (`compressed/json`), jadi **Retry** memuatnya dan tidak menjalankan PySCF lagi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
