# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Optimize stage, the task `get_lucj_params` in the workflow, fits the ansatz to the QPU before any circuit exists. ffsim builds the LUCJ operator from $t_2$ with only the interactions that a heavy-hex lattice runs without SWAP gates. These are the same-spin pairs of neighboring orbitals and the opposite-spin pairs on every fourth orbital, at most five on a heavy-hex (Heron) processor. ffsim then compresses the operator (`optimize=True`, on by default in the workflow) so that one layer reproduces $t_2$ more closely.\n"
msgstr "Tahap Optimize, yaitu task `get_lucj_params` di workflow, menyesuaikan ansatz dengan QPU sebelum circuit apa pun ada. ffsim membangun operator LUCJ dari $t_2$ hanya dengan interaksi yang bisa dijalankan lattice heavy-hex tanpa SWAP gate. Interaksi ini adalah pasangan spin sama dari orbital bertetangga dan pasangan spin berlawanan pada setiap orbital keempat, paling banyak lima pada prosesor heavy-hex (Heron). Setelah itu ffsim mengompresi operator (`optimize=True`, aktif secara default di workflow) supaya satu layer mereproduksi $t_2$ dengan lebih akurat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace:** The task `get_lucj_params` has the tag `optimize`. Its result carries everything that the circuit needs, so one arrow leads from it to `quantum_sampling`.\n"
msgstr "**Trace:** Task `get_lucj_params` punya tag `optimize`. Hasilnya membawa semua yang dibutuhkan circuit, jadi satu panah mengarah dari sana ke `quantum_sampling`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Configure:** The **Circuit** group of the run form sets the LUCJ layers, the compression and its iteration limit, and the **QPU Topology** (`heavy-hex` or `square`), which sets the interaction pairs. The `sqd-advanced-settings` block holds reset mitigation and the transpiler settings (the optimization level and the SABRE layout search) that the Execute stage uses.\n"
msgstr "**Configure:** Grup **Circuit** di form run mengatur layer LUCJ, kompresi beserta batas iterasinya, dan **QPU Topology** (`heavy-hex` atau `square`), yang menentukan pasangan interaksi. Block `sqd-advanced-settings` menyimpan reset mitigation dan pengaturan transpiler (tingkat optimisasi dan pencarian layout SABRE) yang dipakai tahap Execute.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resume:** The result is persisted (`compressed/pickle`), so a long compression runs only one time, even if you retry the run.\n"
msgstr "**Resume:** Hasilnya disimpan secara persisten (`compressed/pickle`), jadi kompresi yang lama hanya berjalan sekali, bahkan kalau kamu me-retry run.\n"

