msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi memakai primitive Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Execute stage, the task `quantum_sampling` in the workflow, builds the circuit (Hartree-Fock state, LUCJ operator, and measurement),\n"
"transpiles it for the QPU, and samples it. The ffsim `PRE_INIT` passes run first in the\n"
"transpiler and turn the ffsim gates into efficient native-gate sequences. This notebook\n"
"samples with Qiskit Runtime on `ibm_fez`. Replace `ibm_fez` with a backend that your instance\n"
"can use. The workflow samples with QRMI instead, in a Slurm job that holds the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tahap Execute, yaitu task `quantum_sampling` di workflow, membangun circuit (state Hartree-Fock, operator LUCJ, dan pengukuran),\n"
"mentranspilasinya untuk QPU, lalu men-sample-nya. Pass `PRE_INIT` dari ffsim berjalan lebih dulu di\n"
"transpiler dan mengubah gate ffsim menjadi urutan native gate yang efisien. Notebook ini\n"
"melakukan sampling dengan Qiskit Runtime di `ibm_fez`. Ganti `ibm_fez` dengan backend yang bisa dipakai\n"
"instance kamu. Workflow melakukan sampling lewat QRMI, di dalam job Slurm yang menahan QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a baseline, draw the same number of uniform random bitstrings, as the workflow does with\n"
"**Quantum Source** set to `random`. The following cell also prints the fraction of each sample\n"
"set with the correct electron numbers. Step 4 compares SQD on the two sample sets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai baseline, ambil bitstring acak seragam dalam jumlah yang sama, seperti yang dilakukan workflow dengan\n"
"**Quantum Source** diatur ke `random`. Cell berikut juga mencetak fraksi dari setiap set sample\n"
"yang punya jumlah elektron yang benar. Langkah 4 membandingkan SQD pada kedua set sample.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `quantum_sampling` has the tag `execute`, and the task\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` runs inside it. The workflow host prepares the circuit and submits a\n"
"Slurm job that requests the QPU. On the compute node, the SPANK plugin opens the QPU session,\n"
"and the QRMI worker transpiles and samples the circuit.\n"
"The task logs show the walltime of the Slurm job, the two-qubit depth of the transpiled\n"
"circuit, and, when sampling completes, the IBM Quantum job ID and the QPU execution time.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Trace:** Task `quantum_sampling` punya tag `execute`, dan task\n"
"`build_lucj_circuit` berjalan di dalamnya. Workflow host menyiapkan circuit dan mengirim\n"
"job Slurm yang meminta QPU. Di compute node, plugin SPANK membuka session QPU,\n"
"dan worker QRMI mentranspilasi serta men-sample circuit.\n"
"Log task menampilkan walltime job Slurm, kedalaman dua-qubit dari circuit hasil transpilasi,\n"
"dan, saat sampling selesai, ID job IBM Quantum dan waktu eksekusi QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **Sampling** group of the run form sets the shots and the source of the\n"
"samples, which is the `qrmi-runtime` block, the job of an earlier run, or random bitstrings.\n"
"The QRMI blocks hold where and how the sampler job runs, and the credentials stay on the\n"
"cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Configure:** Grup **Sampling** di form run mengatur jumlah shot dan sumber\n"
"sample, yaitu block `qrmi-runtime`, job dari run sebelumnya, atau bitstring acak.\n"
"Block QRMI menyimpan di mana dan bagaimana job sampler berjalan, dan kredensial tetap berada di\n"
"cluster.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
