# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trace:** The task `sqd_loop` has the tag `post-process`. It receives the samples and\n"
"the integrals, so the graph shows two arrows into it. Each batch is one `FulqrumSolverJob`\n"
"call, a `solve_eigenstate` task that submits one Slurm job running Fulqrum. The batches of a\n"
"round run concurrently on the compute nodes. The `sqd-configuration-recovery` artifact lists\n"
"the energy and dimension of every subspace in every round.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Trace:** Task `sqd_loop` punya tag `post-process`. Task ini menerima sample dan\n"
"integral, jadi grafik menampilkan dua panah masuk ke sana. Setiap batch adalah satu panggilan\n"
"`FulqrumSolverJob`, yaitu task `solve_eigenstate` yang mengirim satu job Slurm yang menjalankan Fulqrum. Batch dalam satu\n"
"putaran berjalan bersamaan di compute node. Artifact `sqd-configuration-recovery` mencantumkan\n"
"energi dan dimensi setiap subruang di setiap putaran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Configure:** The **SQD** group of the run form sets the subspace dimension, the number of\n"
"batches, and the number of rounds. **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) in the\n"
"run form replaces the **Solver Block** of `sqd-advanced-settings` for one run, for example with\n"
"a DICE or SBD block. The eigensolver (PRIMME), threads, and walltime are in the\n"
"`sqd-fulqrum-solver` block and its execution profile. The flow loads the solver block before\n"
"any stage, so a wrong block name fails the run before it uses the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Configure:** Grup **SQD** di form run mengatur dimensi subruang, jumlah\n"
"batch, dan jumlah putaran. **Solver Block Override** (`solver_block_ref`) di\n"
"form run menggantikan **Solver Block** dari `sqd-advanced-settings` untuk satu run, misalnya dengan\n"
"block DICE atau SBD. Eigensolver (PRIMME), thread, dan walltime ada di block\n"
"`sqd-fulqrum-solver` dan execution profile-nya. Flow memuat solver block sebelum\n"
"tahap apa pun, jadi nama block yang salah menggagalkan run sebelum memakai QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resume:** `sqd_loop` is not cached, but it saves a checkpoint after every round, in\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` under the solver's `work_dir`. The checkpoint\n"
"holds the occupancies that seed the next round and the best energy so far. On **Retry**,\n"
"`sqd_loop` continues after the last completed round, with the current blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Resume:** `sqd_loop` tidak di-cache, tapi menyimpan checkpoint setelah setiap putaran, di\n"
"`sqd_checkpoints/<flow run id>/ckpt_t00_w0.npz` di bawah `work_dir` milik solver. Checkpoint\n"
"berisi okupansi yang menjadi seed putaran berikutnya dan energi terbaik sejauh ini. Pada **Retry**,\n"
"`sqd_loop` melanjutkan setelah putaran terakhir yang selesai, dengan block saat ini.\n"

