msgstr "![The custom run form of the sqd deployment, with FCIDump File set to the N2 FCIDUMP file.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/submit.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a first run without the QPU, set **Quantum Source** to `random`, which runs the solver jobs on uniform random bitstrings. To sample through IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) from the workflow host instead of a Slurm job, save a `QrmiRuntimeBlock` with `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (the `[runtime]` table of `sqd_blocks.toml`, in place of `[qrmi]`), and name it in **QRMI Runtime Block**. This block reads the API key from the `qrmi_config.json` file of the workflow host.\n"
msgstr "Untuk run pertama tanpa QPU, atur **Quantum Source** ke `random`, yang menjalankan job solver pada bitstring acak seragam. Untuk melakukan sampling lewat IBM Quantum Platform (IQP) dari workflow host dan bukan dari job Slurm, simpan `QrmiRuntimeBlock` dengan `scheduler = \"iqp\"` (tabel `[runtime]` di `sqd_blocks.toml`, menggantikan `[qrmi]`), lalu sebutkan namanya di **QRMI Runtime Block**. Block ini membaca API key dari file `qrmi_config.json` milik workflow host.\n"

