# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The energy that the flow reports is the lowest energy in the `sqd-configuration-recovery` table. Each solver job leaves a `job_<timestamp>_<id>` directory under `work_dir`. The directory holds the rendered Slurm script, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, and the Slurm output. It also holds `output.npz` and `result.json` on success, or `error.json` on failure. Use `sacct` to see the jobs of the run.\n"
msgstr "Energi yang dilaporkan flow adalah energi terendah di tabel `sqd-configuration-recovery`. Setiap job solver meninggalkan direktori `job_<timestamp>_<id>` di bawah `work_dir`. Direktori itu berisi script Slurm hasil render, `input.npz`, `solver.json`, dan output Slurm. Direktori itu juga berisi `output.npz` dan `result.json` jika berhasil, atau `error.json` jika gagal. Pakai `sacct` untuk melihat job dari run tersebut.\n"

